Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.06,0:00:26.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:11.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《蓝宝石案》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里是莫卡伯爵夫人家 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countess of Morcar's, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐 她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, she's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她下马车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's getting out of the carriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 赖德 赶紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ryder, get a move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修好了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}look lively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:02:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:02:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 动作快点 - 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get moving. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵夫人讨厌看到管子工在她家晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her ladyship won't want workmen under her feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 别担心 我修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I finished, don't worry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听你的 我可加紧速度干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}quick job, like you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是美奂绝伦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, yeah, nice, nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵夫人的 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Countess, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就约会时戴戴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have to get by appointment only…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, lad, out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放一边就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.83,0:04:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你们仨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, for the three of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, milady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.43,0:04:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝您圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Merry Christmas, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我叫杯茶 丘萨克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring for tea, Cusack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.43,0:04:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得喝杯茶 提提神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need something to sustain me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:05:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞前夕的准备工作真是折磨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do find preparing for Christmas quite an ordeal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您说得对 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后 再洗个澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, a bath, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蓝宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blue carbuncle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:06:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蓝宝石 被偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the blue carbuncle, it's stolen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.72,0:06:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把眼睛睁开 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open them up, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 约翰 她会喜欢的 这太美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, John, she'll love it, it is beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像她的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like her mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我们买得起吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can we afford it, though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你 我最近赚了点小钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, I made a nice little bob or two lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使没钱 现在可是圣诞节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I hadn't, it's Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真体贴 约翰·霍纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man, John Horner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a lucky man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妻儿在旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wife and kids like I've got, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快活似神仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}means as good as a king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.89,0:06:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那买这洋娃娃给女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's the doll for the girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这船送咱的儿子 你说如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the boat for the boy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迫不及待销赃了 霍纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spending the loot already, are we, Horner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什么都没做 你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done nothing, what do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:06:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·弗雷德里克·霍纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Frederick Horner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你因盗窃莫卡伯爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hereby arrest you on the charge of stealing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名下价值连城的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the valuable gem known as the blue carbuncle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蓝宝石而被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the property of the Countess of Morcar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你所说的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没偷 我真的没偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it, I tell you, I didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.51,0:07:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人看到你 旅馆里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man saw you. The man at the hotel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}口里描述的就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave a very good description of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 治安官 - 不是我偷的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Constable. - I didn't do it, I tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.82,0:07:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放我走 真的不是我偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me go, will you, I didn't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.96,0:07:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得森先生 阿伯赛特的看门人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Peterson, the commissionaire from Upasit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他有事找你 - 别来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- he'd like a word with you. - Oh, please, go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 抱歉打扰您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to disturb you, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得森 把鹅放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peterson, put down your goose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your, your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你买了只肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fine purchase, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.52,0:09:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就很喜欢圣诞大餐吃肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I myself favor a goose for Christmas dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可问题也出在这 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's part of the problem, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这鹅不是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bird is not mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您也许会说 是我弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might say, I come by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.56,0:09:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「献给亨利·贝克太太」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, "for Mrs. Henry Baker, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然 这不是你的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and obviously, not your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.37,0:09:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there were peculiar circumstances, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道该如何处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't know what to do for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}报警有点太小题大作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hardly seemed a matter for the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我便和我太太说了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I talked to the wife about it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她建议我来找您\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she suggested I come and see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太太很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wise Mrs. Peterson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.09,0:09:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐下吧 我亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, my dear fellow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把特殊情况给我讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}and describe these peculiar circumstances to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.08,0:09:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, it was like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.25,0:09:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚我在归家途中 我刚参加完一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night I was on my way home from a little, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小小的聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每年的这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at this time of the year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们几个看门人凑在一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of us commissionairs meet to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 交换下节日祝福 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To wish each other the season's greetings. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.05,0:10:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}节日祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}The season's greetings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.44,0:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您真厉害 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a top, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.68,0:10:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敬你的健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your good health, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如我之前说的 我在归家途中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, as I was saying, I was on my way home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遇到了意外事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I came across what you would only describe as a frakel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.63,0:11:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 你们在干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oy, what's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.97,0:11:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 是警察…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blimey, it's a copper, …{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家快逃 快逃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here. Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是在帮你啊 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to help you, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}流氓都往一个方向跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the roughs ran off in one direction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}醉鬼也往相反方向溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the drunk fellow ran off in the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想叫住他 但他显然以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to stop him, but he no doubt thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是个治安官 打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a constable about to apprehend him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以打破玻璃罪逮捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the breaking of the window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你就掳获了两样战利品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so you left with the spoils of victory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这顶破旧的毡帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the shape of that battered hat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和一只上等的圣诞肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a most unimpeachable Christmas goose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我迫切希望将它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of which I would willingly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}物归原主 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}have returned to their rightful owners, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不知道该从何下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the truth is, I didn't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的彼得森 我明白你的困境了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Peterson, I do see your problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样 我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, as I say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和太太商量过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I discussed the matter with the good lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}决定把这两样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we decided that I would bring both{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帽子和鹅带到您这 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}the goose and the hat to you, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.32,0:12:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道这件小事能否引起\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as how even the slightest of problems is of interest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.27,0:12:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这一特殊行业人士的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you in your particular line of occupation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿我没浪费您的时间 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you don't think I'm wasting your time, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 看门人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now then, Commissionaire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你自家的鹅买好了吗？- 还没呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- have you purchased your own bird? - No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我建议你把这只鹅带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I suggest that you carry off this goose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去完成它的最终命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that it may fulfill its ultimate destiny, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我就好好保存失去了圣诞大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I retain the battered hat of the unknown gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的素未谋面的先生的破旧毡帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has lost his Christmas dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.73,0:12:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就听你的 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you think I should, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管天气寒冷 但有迹象表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}For there are signs, in spite of the frost, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该吃掉它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this bird should be prepared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.31,0:12:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没必要再放着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}without unnecessary delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我就不客气了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if that's all right, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:12:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一有进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep you in touch with the developments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 祝您节日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, may I wish you the complements of the season.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也祝你和你的太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to you and your good wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们还是没找到宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you still haven't found the jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是还没 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, no, milady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们抓到小偷了 就是霍纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we do have the man, Horner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那宝石的线索呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or have a clue as to its whereabouts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们推断\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think we may assume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有帮凶 也许不止一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he had one accomplice, if not more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.90,0:13:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what of that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.79,0:13:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 和小说的情节恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contrary to popular fiction, milady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小偷都没什么信誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is very little honor amongst thieves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一看到钱就把信誉抛之脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even less with the right inducement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱 你是指悬赏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inducement, do you mean a reward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.80,0:13:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为什么要提供赏金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why should I offer a reward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以我的经验 这是相当有效的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my experience, and it is considerable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.80,0:14:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现悬赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have found that the offer of a reward{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能把那个贪婪的小偷给引出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}would very soon set the greedy cat amongst the criminal pigeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.30,0:14:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果24小时内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be very surprised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人来领赏 那才叫奇怪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I did not gain a result within 24 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.30,0:14:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那悬赏多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 你在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莫卡伯爵夫人悬赏1千英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Countess of Morcar is offering a thousand pounds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻找蓝宝石的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the return of the blue carbuncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}B区布雷兹特里特巡官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector Bradstreet of B Division{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}负责此案\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in charge of the case, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他已经逮捕了约翰·霍纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has arrested Mr. John Horner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}36岁 是个水管工\N{\fnArial\fs30}a plumber, age 36, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.10,0:14:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强烈申辩自己是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who protested his innocence in the strongest terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于间接证据确凿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circumstantial evidence was so strong that the case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此案已移交给巡回审判庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been referred to the Assizes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍纳在诉讼中情绪激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horner, who showed signs of intense emotion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做最后陈述时竟昏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the proceedings, faded away at the conclusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.60,0:15:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被抬出了法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was carried from the court.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 你正忙着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, excuse me, you are engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰到你研究帽子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am interrupting your study of that hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.50,0:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这完全是件毫无价值的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, the matter is a perfectly trivial one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但与它有关的几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there are points in connection with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不是那么无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}which are not devoid of interest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至还有教益\N{\fnArial\fs30}even of instruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想 这顶帽子看似普通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose that homely as it looks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实则关系到某件性命攸关的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thing has some deadly story linked to it that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这条线索能帮你解开某个疑团\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the clue which will guide you in the solution of some mystery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警恶惩奸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the punishment of some crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是众多离奇小事中的一件罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is just one of those whimsical little instance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}400万人口挤在几平方英里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that will occur when you have four million people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弹丸之地 这种事少不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}jostling each other within the space of a few square miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你从这顶破毡帽上瞧出了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you gather from that battered old felt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.10,0:15:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你素来明白我的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know my methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对戴这么特别的毡帽的人的个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you yourself gather as to the individuality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你推测出什么来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the man who has worn this particular article?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是连同一只肥鹅送过来的 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was accompanied by a goose, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肥鹅的左腿上系着张小卡片 写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For Mrs. Henry Baker, " was printed upon a small card{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「献给亨利·贝克夫人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}attached to the bird's left leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.00,0:16:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了这缩写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apart from the initials inside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}HB 假设是指「亨利·贝克」\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.B., presumably Henry Baker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看不出其他啥信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恰恰相反 华生 你什么都能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, Watson, you can see everything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你没有就所看到的东西作出推论\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you fail to reason for what you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对自己的推论能力太缺乏信心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are too timid in drawing your inferences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, pray, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉我你从这帽子上作出了啥推论？\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me what it is that you can infer from that hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个学识渊博的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the man is highly intellectual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一眼就能看出\N{\fnArial\fs30}is, of course, obvious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且在过去三年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And also that he was fairly well-to-do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生活相当富裕\N{\fnArial\fs30}within the past three years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然他目前穷困潦倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}although now he has fallen upon evil days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他过去很有远见 如今已大不如前\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had foresight, but less now than formerly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精神日渐颓废\N{\fnArial\fs30}pointing to a moral retrogression, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加上家道中落\N{\fnArial\fs30}which, when taken with the decline of his fortunes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.90,0:17:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该染上了恶习 也许是酗酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}seems to indicate an evil influence, probably drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.50,0:17:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕这也是他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may account also for the fact that his wife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不再爱他的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}has ceased to love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他仍保有最后的自尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has, however, retained some degree of self-respect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他深居简出\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he leads a sedentary life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全缺乏锻炼\N{\fnArial\fs30}is out of training entirely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是个中年人 头发灰白\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's middle-aged, has grizzled hair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近几天刚理过发\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he has had cut within the last few days, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头发上还抹了柠檬膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and which he anoints with lime-cream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他家里绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is also highly improbable that he has gas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有煤油灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}laid on in his house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.40,0:17:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now you are certainly joking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.50,0:17:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本不是玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不怀疑我很迟钝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have no doubt that I am very stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比方说 你怎么推出他学识渊博？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, how do you deduce that the man is intellectual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是一个容积的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a question of cubic capacity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}脑袋那么大的人 脑子里肯定有不少货\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man with so large a head must have something in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家道中落呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the decline in his fortunes, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种平沿卷边帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}These flat brims with the curled edges{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在三年前很流行\N{\fnArial\fs30}came in three years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 这是顶质量上乘的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a hat of the very best quality, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧瞧这丝绸的箍带和华贵的衬里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the band of ribbed silk and the excellent lining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他三年前买得起这么贵的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this man could afford so expensive a hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而以后再没添置过新帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}three years ago, and has had no hat since, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么显然他失势潦倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then he has assuredly gone down in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.10,0:18:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他过去有远见如今精神颓废又怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the foresight and the moral retrogression?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.30,0:18:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就说明他有远见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, here is the foresight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.70,0:18:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出售的帽子是不附带松紧带的\N{\fnArial\fs30}these securers are never sold upon hats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以这是他订做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this man ordered one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这恰好说明他有远见\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is a sign of a certain amount of foresight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他用这种方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}since he went out of his way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.40,0:18:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}防止帽子被风刮跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take precaution against the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你看 他把松紧带坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as you see that he has broken the elastic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却不愿花点时间重新订一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has not troubled to replace it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说明他意志消沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}a weakening nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此外还有几点 他是个中年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The further points, that he is middle-aged, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头发灰白 最近刚理过发\N{\fnArial\fs30}that his hair is grizzled, that it has been cut recently, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}头上抹过柠檬膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that he anoints it with lime-cream, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.90,0:19:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些都可以从帽子衬里\N{\fnArial\fs30}can all to be gathered by an inspection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.30,0:19:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下部的检查中推断出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the lower part of the lining, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.90,0:19:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这的湿迹 显然 他出汗量很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness the moisture, obviously a free perspirer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.90,0:19:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以不是一个勤于锻炼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}therefore, not in the best of training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他… 他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his… his wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他刚说她不再爱他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said she had ceased to love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这帽子几周没刷过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hat has not been brushed for weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我看到一个男人的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I see a man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已经积了个把星期的灰尘\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a week's accumulation of dust upon his hat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他的妻子却置之不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his wife has allowed him to go out in such a state, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恐怕他已很不幸地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear that he has been unfortunate enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失去他妻子的爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lose his wife's affections.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也许是单身汉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might be a bachelor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 他想将鹅作为示好礼物送他妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay, but he brought a goose as a peace offering to his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别忘了系在鹅腿上的那张卡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the card attached to the bird's leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是能找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, you have an answer to everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute, just a minute, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么推断出他家没有煤油灯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do you deduce that there is no gas laid on in his house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一滴烛油\N{\fnArial\fs30}One tallow candle stain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或两滴烛油 也许是偶然滴到\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even two, might come by chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是 华生 当我看到有不只5滴时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I see, Watson, no less than five, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就知道他不可能从煤油灯上沾到烛油\N{\fnArial\fs30}he never got candle stains from a gas jet, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.20,0:20:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}满意了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you satisfied?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你脑子真灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's all very ingenious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只鹅 福尔摩斯先生 那只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes, the goose, the goose, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.20,0:20:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦 难道它又活了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what of it, man, has it come back to life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扑拉着翅膀从厨房的窗口飞出去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and flapped off through the kitchen window?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no sir, no sir, but see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妻子在嗉囊里发现了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}see what the wife found in its crop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天呐 彼得森 这确实是件秘藏的珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Jove, Peterson, this is a treasure-trove indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.40,0:20:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道这是什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you've got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一颗钻石 一颗宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}A diamond, a precious stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用它割玻璃像割油泥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It cuts glass like it was putty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.60,0:20:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是一颗平常的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is more than a precious stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而是那颗名贵的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the precious stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界旅馆盗窃案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hotel Cosmopolitan robbery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那颗蓝宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}the blue carbuncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千真万确\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blue carbuncle, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这绝对是独一无二的珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is absolutely unique, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的价值只能大约估计\N{\fnArial\fs30}its value can only be conjectured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.00,0:21:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而悬赏的1000英镑报酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your reward, Peterson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不到这颗蓝宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}of 1000 pounds is not within a twentieth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}市价的1/20\N{\fnArial\fs30}of its market price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1000英镑 老天爷呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand pounds, oh, Lord have mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得承认 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must admit, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从帽子上推断出来的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my deductions in regard to this hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其重要性可是陡然大增\N{\fnArial\fs30}have suddenly assumed a more important aspect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, point taken, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在要解决的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the question for us now to solve is to trace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理清从宝石被盗到发现鹅的嗦囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}the sequence of events from a rifled jewel case at one end, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这期间一系列事件的顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the crop of a goose at the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是那颗宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.20,0:21:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那颗宝石来自那只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stone came from the goose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.00,0:21:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只鹅来自亨利·贝克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}the goose came from Mr. Henry Baker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.10,0:22:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他戴着顶破毡帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gentleman with the shabby hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其他特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the other characteristics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在要做的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now, we must set ourselves very seriously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}认真找到这位先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}to finding this gentleman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.50,0:22:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且弄清他在这起神秘事件中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to ascertaining what part he had to play{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扮演何种角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this little mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兹于古治街拐角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found at the corner of Goodge Street, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拣到鹅一只和黑毡帽一顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}a goose and a black felt hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.20,0:22:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利·贝克先生请于晚六点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Henry Baker can have same by applying at 6:30 this evening{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到贝克街221B房领回 简单又明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 221B, Baker Street, clear and concise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 可他会看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, very, but will he see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 他肯定会留意晚报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sure he will keep an eye on the evening papers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对穷人来说 这损失也算惨重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the poor man, the loss was a heavy one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.50,0:22:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得森 把它送到广告公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Peterson, uh, just nip down to the advertising agency{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.90,0:22:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且刊登在所有的晚报上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have this put in all the evening papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}登在哪家报纸上 先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, one, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《环球报》《星报》《蓓尔美尔报》《圣詹姆斯宫报》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Globe, Star, Pall Mall, St. James's Bissett, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.60,0:22:43.60,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《回声报》《新闻晚报》《标准报》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo, Evening News, Standard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和所有你得想到的报纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the others that may occur to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就去办 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那宝石怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这颗宝石我先保存着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall keep the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.70,0:22:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 彼得森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Peterson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.80,0:22:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}举手之劳 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 彼得森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and Peterson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:23:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你回来的路上能帮我买只鹅吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, would you pick up a goose on your way back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.70,0:23:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把钱给他 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him the money, will you, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.10,0:23:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须给亨利·贝克先生买一只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must have something to give Mr. Henry Baker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来代替\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take the place of the one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们全家要享用的那只\N{\fnArial\fs30}which your family will very soon be devouring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.60,0:23:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 谢谢你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1000英镑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand pounds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1000英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1000英镑 1000英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand pounds, a thousand pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.60,0:23:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你打算怎么处理这颗宝石？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, what, uh, will you do with the stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把它放进我的陈列柜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall keep it in my museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.60,0:23:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Horner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.20,0:23:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵夫人对我很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Ladyship is not at all pleased with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.10,0:23:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你虽然被关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be under lock and key, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她更关心宝石的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she'd rather her blue carbuncle was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.90,0:24:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没拿过宝石 治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never took it Inspector…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.50,0:24:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.00,0:24:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把它藏哪了 说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what you did with it, and, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我可以帮你向法官求情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put in a good word at your trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.10,0:24:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果你不识相\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, if you don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从我娶了杰瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been on the straight for years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.70,0:24:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就一直安分守己\N{\fnArial\fs30}ever since I married Jenny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当法官得知了你的前科\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when the judge hears about your previous conviction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕你再也见不到你的娇妻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might never see your pretty wife again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.50,0:24:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我抓到你了 霍纳 但我更需要宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got you, Horner, but I need that jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.90,0:24:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是颗美仑美奂的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bonny thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.40,0:24:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看啊 多么光彩照人\N{\fnArial\fs30}just see how it glints and sparkles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 它又是罪恶的根源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, it is a nucleus and focus of crime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.10,0:24:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每颗珍贵的宝石无不如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}every good stone is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们是魔鬼得意的诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are the devil's pet baits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.60,0:24:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在更大更古老的宝石上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the larger and older jewels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.30,0:24:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每一个切割面都代表着残忍的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}every facet may stand for a bloody deed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.90,0:25:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是在华南厦门的河边被发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was found in the banks of the Amoy River in southern China, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的奇特之处在于 除了它是蓝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is remarkable in having every characteristic of the carbuncle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.70,0:25:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它拥有红宝石的一切特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}save that it is blue instead of ruby red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.40,0:25:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这颗宝石问世以来不到20年\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stone is not yet twenty years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.30,0:25:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管流传在世不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}In spite of its youth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.30,0:25:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但已有一段不堪的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}it already has a sinister history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.30,0:25:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两起谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been two murders, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.50,0:25:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起硫酸毁容案 一起自杀事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}a vitriol-throwing, a suicide, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.80,0:25:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有几起抢劫案都归因于\N{\fnArial\fs30}and several robberies brought about for the sake{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.80,0:25:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这颗重四十谷的结晶碳\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this forty-grain weight of crystallized charcoal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.50,0:25:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁会想到如此美的饰物竟是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would think that so pretty a toy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.60,0:25:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}向绞刑架和监狱输送罪犯的供应商呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be a purveyor to the gallows and the prison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.10,0:25:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.80,0:25:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是亨利·贝克先生吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Henry Baker, I believe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.50,0:25:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐近壁炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, draw near the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天真冷啊 我想你的血液循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a cold night and I observe that your circulation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.90,0:26:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在夏天一定比在冬天强\N{\fnArial\fs30}is more adapted for summer than for winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快坐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的好友兼搭档 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my friend and colleague, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.80,0:26:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Baker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的帽子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that your hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.40,0:26:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这的确是我的帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, oh, it is undoubtedly my hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.10,0:26:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.20,0:26:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想登寻物启事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have advertised its loss but shillings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.90,0:26:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我已囊中羞涩 大不如前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have not been so plentiful with me as they once were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.30,0:26:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为那些袭击我的流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no doubt that the gang of roughs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抢走了帽子和鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}who assaulted me had carried off both my hat and the bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.10,0:26:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想没有必要为拿不回的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not care to spend more money{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.80,0:26:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再多花钱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a hopeless attempt at recovering them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 这我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well, of course, that is very understandable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.10,0:26:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 你的那只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way, about your bird, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.60,0:27:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不得已把它给吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were compelled to eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To eat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不这么做 那鹅就真的不堪食用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have been of little use to anyone had we not done so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.30,0:27:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们又买了一只鹅 就在餐柜上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have another goose upon the sideboard there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.90,0:27:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想它和你那只鹅应该差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I presume will answer your purpose equally well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}重量不相上下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is about the same weight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.20,0:27:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且十分鲜嫩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perfectly fresh, as you can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.90,0:27:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 那当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, most certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.10,0:27:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 我们还留着原来那只鹅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we have kept the feathers, legs, crop, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.00,0:27:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}羽毛 腿 嗉囊等等 如果你想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so on of your own bird, if you so wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为我的历险纪念品也许有点用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be useful to me as relics of my adventure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除此之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}but beyond that I can hardly see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.50,0:27:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看不出我那鹅的零星碎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}what use the disjectamembra of my old acquaintance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.80,0:27:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我有何用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}could possibly be to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.20,0:27:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, sir, with your permission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我… 我想我关心的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I shall confine my attentions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在你餐柜上看到的那只肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the excellent bird which I perceive upon your sideboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.40,0:27:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be interested to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.40,0:27:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那只鹅是在哪买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}where the other bird came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.00,0:27:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对饲养家禽很有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I am somewhat of a fowl fancier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.40,0:28:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很少见到如此好的肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have seldom seen a better grown bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.40,0:28:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我对你买下鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be of great interest to me to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的细节极有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}precisely how it came into your possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是俱乐部给我的 先生 一个鹅俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the club, sir, the goose club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.30,0:28:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鹅俱乐部？说得再具体点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The goose club, the exact circumstances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.10,0:28:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我… 我不是个富人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I am not a rich man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正如你看到的 先生 我的生活窘迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you may see, sir, but I make a humble living, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也不失尊严 这样说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a respectable one, if I may say so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在大英博物馆工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the British Museum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做研究？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Studying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.80,0:28:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Studying, you might say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.40,0:28:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也帮助别人做研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}and helping others with their studies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.90,0:28:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看过很多书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I have a certain knowledge of books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天 我提早下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day, sir, I had finished work early{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.90,0:28:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午就离开了博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and left the museum in the afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.20,0:28:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我办完私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a little business to attend to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.70,0:28:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就去了阿尔法小酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}before calling in at the Alpha Public House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.70,0:28:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}博物馆的好些同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Several of us who work in the museum{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:28:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经常去那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}frequent that establishment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.10,0:29:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今年 我们的好店主\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this year our good host, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.30,0:29:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}温迪盖特先生 创办了一个鹅俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Windigate, had instigated a goose club, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.00,0:29:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考虑到每周向俱乐部交纳几便士\N{\fnArial\fs30}by which, on consideration of some few pence each week, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.20,0:29:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在圣诞节都收到一只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were to receive a bird at Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.50,0:29:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你的 贝克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we are, Mr. Baker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.70,0:29:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说好的 一只上等肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}a very fine bird, as promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是难得一见的肥鹅 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magnificent specimen, indeed, landlord, eh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.00,0:29:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这下能和你妻子重修旧好了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put you back in the wife's good books, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.90,0:29:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕她对我还是有点不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she is still somewhat irked with me, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.10,0:29:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我又找到能赚钱的工作时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things may doubtless improve when I am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.00,0:29:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切肯定会有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}once more in gainful employment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.20,0:29:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 肯定是学术性的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, an academic nature, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很有前途的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I have expectations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是上次欠你的8便士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I owe you one last payment of eight pennies, eh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.60,0:29:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一夜暴富」了 贝克先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Struck it rich, have we, Mr. B?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.70,0:29:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我碰巧遇到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chanced upon an acquaintance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}富有同情心的熟人 其实呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}of sympathetic disposition, I, that is to say, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.60,0:30:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我卖给他几本我的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold some of my books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.90,0:30:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是你的书吧 贝克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not your books, Mr. Baker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.90,0:30:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也是迫不得已 温迪盖特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needs must, Mr. Windigate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.50,0:30:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今年的冬天比以往更窘迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and at this season of the year more than ever, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.00,0:30:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能割舍所爱之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must not deprive those we love, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.80,0:30:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所娶之人更应好好珍惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even those to whom we are married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.90,0:30:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先把这份示好礼物放一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, if you will set aside this impressive peace offering, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.90,0:30:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得缓解下压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall fortify myself for the fray{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.60,0:30:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以给我来一大杯威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a large glass of whiskey, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.00,0:30:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再来一品脱你这最好的啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a pint of your most excellent beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐 贝克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same to you, Mr. Baker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.90,0:31:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我回家的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, on my way home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我被一群流氓袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was attacked by the gang of roughs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.60,0:31:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为他们偷了我的鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}who I believed had stolen the goose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.10,0:31:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的帽子也在扭打中丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hat came off in the scuffle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.50,0:31:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我… 我就记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I remember little of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.80,0:31:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个穿制服的警官出现在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}save that a uniformed officer appeared on the scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.60,0:31:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是我们都逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we all made off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.20,0:31:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是当然 我们能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course, we quite understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.40,0:31:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那种情况下嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.50,0:31:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果好 才是真的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all is well that ends well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.90,0:31:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对您的费心深表谢意 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am most indebted to you, sir, for your trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.10,0:31:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这顶苏格兰帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A scottish bonnet, I fear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.60,0:31:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既不符合我的年龄 也不符合我的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}is fitted neither to my years nor to my dignity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.30,0:31:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}节日快乐 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My complements of the season to you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.50,0:31:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是啊 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to you, too, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.80,0:31:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, by the way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.00,0:31:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你家有煤油灯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you have gas laid on in your house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.90,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}煤油灯 当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas, alas, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.00,0:32:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jolly good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.10,0:32:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也祝您俩圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to you both, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.70,0:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 亨利·贝克先生的事到此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, so much for Mr. Henry Baker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.70,0:32:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他显然对宝石的事一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously knows nothing of the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.00,0:32:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.10,0:32:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你饿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, do you need nourishment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.60,0:32:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not particularly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.60,0:32:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.30,0:32:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 把我们的晚餐改成夜宵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson, we shall turn dinner into supper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.10,0:32:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要顺藤摸瓜 趁热打铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will follow up this clue while it is still hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能比夜宵还热么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is more than the supper will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.70,0:32:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好 先生们 今晚真是冷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, gentlemen, and a very cold one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实是啊 老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, indeed, landlord, it is indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.90,0:32:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们想喝什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what shall be your pleasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.60,0:32:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啤酒 华生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beer, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.50,0:32:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？噢 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, yes, splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.30,0:32:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来两杯你这最好的啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of your very best glasses of beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.60,0:32:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍等 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.90,0:33:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你的啤酒和你的鹅一样好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your beer should be excellent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.20,0:33:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是最纯正的啤酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it is as good as your geese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.40,0:33:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的鹅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What geese?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.90,0:33:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半小时前 我们刚和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We were talking, um, half an hour ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.70,0:33:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你鹅俱乐部的会员亨利·贝克先生聊过\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a Mr. Henry Baker, a member of your goose club.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样啊 可那些鹅不是我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but you see, them's not our geese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.30,0:33:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.70,0:33:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从考文特园一个商贩那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got the whole two dozen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}买了24只\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a salesman in Covent Garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.80,0:33:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who might that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.70,0:33:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱肯里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name of Breckinridge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.60,0:33:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个供货商 他那总有好货\N{\fnArial\fs30}a purveyor of the finest quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.10,0:33:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}提醒你 如果你想买只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind you, if it's a bird you're after, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.30,0:33:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以立马去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd get to him as soon as poss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.20,0:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们也知道 现在正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a very busy time of year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.80,0:33:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年中最忙的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you'll appreciate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.40,0:33:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you so much for your advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.40,0:33:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能再来杯啤酒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you have a glass of beer with us, landlord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.00,0:33:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, God bless you for a gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.60,0:34:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就去找布莱肯里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for Mr. Breckinridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.10,0:34:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非得现在去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't it wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.20,0:34:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 我们正在追踪一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, we have been given a line of investigation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.20,0:34:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被警察忽略了的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has been missed by the police, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.00,0:34:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这条线索机缘巧合落入了我们手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and which a singular chance has placed in our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.60,0:34:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得顺着线索不惜一切 追查到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let us follow it out to the bitter end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.50,0:34:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是不惜一切啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extremely bitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.00,0:34:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在朝南快步前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faces to the south, then, and quick, march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.40,0:34:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.40,0:34:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想相信你 约翰 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to believe you, John, I do, really, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.40,0:34:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我没法反驳警察说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't argue with what the police is saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.40,0:34:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们只说抓我是因为当天我在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're only saying that cause I was there on the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.50,0:34:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是去做零工\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an odd job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的是这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that really the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.80,0:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结婚时 我答应过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised when I married you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.90,0:35:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永不会对你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never tell you a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.10,0:35:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直遵守我的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept my promise, always will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.40,0:35:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.70,0:36:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.30,0:36:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.70,0:36:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你的鹅都卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold out of geese, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.70,0:36:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 明早我可以卖你500只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll have five hundred in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.70,0:36:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}煤油灯亮着的那个摊位上还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the stall over there with the gas fire, try him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.90,0:36:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但人家介绍我到你这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I was recommended to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.80,0:36:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, who by?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.80,0:36:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿尔法小酒店的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}The landlord of the Alpha Public House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.30,0:36:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 他从我这买了24只\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, he had a couple of dozen off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.00,0:36:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些鹅真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good geese, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能知道你是从哪弄来的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where, may I ask, did you get them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.20,0:36:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here then, mister, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what exactly are you driving at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.50,0:36:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有话直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's have it straight, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.30,0:36:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经说得很明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's straight enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.90,0:36:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只想知道你卖给阿尔法店的那些鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply want to know who sold you the geese{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.30,0:36:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁供货的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you supplied to the Alpha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.10,0:37:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想告诉你 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, I'm not gonna tell you, so now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.50,0:37:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是件小事 可我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is of no matter, but I fail to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.50,0:37:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为何如此大动肝火\N{\fnArial\fs30}why you should get so warm over a trifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.30,0:37:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大动肝火 你试试被这样纠缠看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warm, you'd be as warm if you were as pestered as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.40,0:37:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我花大价钱买好货\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I pay good money for a good article{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.60,0:37:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不就完事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that should be an end of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.00,0:37:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 「鹅在哪」\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's where are the geese, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.50,0:37:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「你把鹅卖给谁了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}who have you sold them to, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.90,0:37:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「卖了多少价钱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much will you take for them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.60,0:37:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好像对这批鹅过分关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would think those were the only geese in the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.30,0:37:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能觉得世上没别的鹅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the amount of fuss that's made over them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.70,0:37:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证我和其余来查问的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can assure you that I have no connection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.90,0:37:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}with anybody else who's made inquiries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.10,0:37:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查问？这简直就是审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inquiries, it's more like the inquisition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.80,0:37:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not telling you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.30,0:37:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那打赌只好吹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well then, the bet is off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.50,0:37:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打什么赌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.20,0:37:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打什么赌？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What bet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.50,0:37:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm always ready to back my opinion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.70,0:37:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在家禽问题上的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the matter of fowls, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和我这位朋友赌5英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I have a fiver with my friend here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.70,0:38:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说我选的那只鹅是在农村喂大的 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the bird that I chose is country bred, right, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.90,0:38:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？对对对 有这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Oh, oh, oh, yes, yes, absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.00,0:38:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你输了 因为它是在城里喂大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you've lost your money then, cause it's town bred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.30,0:38:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is nothing of the kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.70,0:38:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.60,0:38:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钱拿来吧 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pay up, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.20,0:38:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think I wouldn't know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.70,0:38:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可是从小就和家禽打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}me, who's been handling fowl since I was a nipper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.30,0:38:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.00,0:38:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖给阿尔法店的鹅全是城里喂大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the birds that went to the Alpha were town bred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.10,0:38:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说服不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never make me believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.80,0:38:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 福尔摩斯 愿赌服输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, do the decent, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.10,0:38:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你愿意打赌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you have a bet, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.70,0:38:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是让你输钱罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be just taking your money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.30,0:38:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我仍愿意拿一金镑和你赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'll have a sovereign with you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.80,0:38:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是为了教训你的固执己见\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to teach you not to be obstinate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.60,0:38:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.20,0:38:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仔细看看 傲慢先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now then, Mr. Cocksure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.00,0:38:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我的帐本\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see these here books here, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.90,0:38:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上面记录了卖鹅给我的人的名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a list of all the folk what I buy off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.70,0:38:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一页上的都是乡下人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, on this page is all me country folk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.40,0:38:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这页用红墨水写的都是城里的供货人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these on this side in red ink are all me town suppliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.20,0:38:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把第三个人的名字给我念出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you read out that third name down to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.80,0:39:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥克肖特太太 布里克斯顿路117号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Oakshott, 117 Brixton Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.80,0:39:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}客户号码249\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, account number 249.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.20,0:39:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 你再看一下总帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, then, turn it up in the ledger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.90,0:39:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥克肖特太太 鸡蛋和家禽供应商？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Oakshott, egg and poultry supplier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.10,0:39:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那最后记的那笔帐是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what's the last entry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.80,0:39:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}24只鹅 收价7先令6便士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-four geese at seven and six pence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.40,0:39:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖给阿尔法小酒店 温迪盖特\N{\fnArial\fs30}sold to Mr. Windigate of the Alpha Public House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.60,0:39:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还有什么话可说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna say now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.40,0:39:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位先生的5英镑呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this gentleman's fiver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得漂亮 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.90,0:39:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚就去见奥克肖特太太吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we see this Mrs. Oakshott tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.80,0:39:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么又是你 你烦不烦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, not you again, I've had enough of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.50,0:39:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都说了 全卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've told you before, clear off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.00,0:40:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听我说 有两只灰冠鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the thing is, there were two gray-headed geese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.50,0:40:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我被你和你的鹅烦透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen, I've had enough of you and those geese.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.30,0:40:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们都见鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you was all at the devil together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.30,0:40:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你再用这些蠢话来烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you come pestering me any more with your silly talk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.60,0:40:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就放狗咬你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll set the dog on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.80,0:40:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听我说 奥克肖特太太告诉我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look here, Mrs. Oakshott told me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.40,0:40:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把奥克肖特太太带来 我会给她答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bring Mrs. Oakshott here, and I'll answer her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.90,0:40:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可这与你何干？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what have you got to do with it, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.70,0:40:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的鹅是从你那买的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I buy the geese off you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 可那里面有只鹅是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No; but one of them was mine all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.00,0:40:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你去找奥克肖特太太要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you go and ask Mrs. Oakshott for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.60,0:40:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她让我来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以去问普鲁士国王要 反正与我无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can ask the King of Prusia, for all I care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.20,0:40:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.50,0:40:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快给我滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, get out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.70,0:40:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}省下我们去布里克斯顿的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may save us a trip to Brixton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.20,0:41:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我刚才无意中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, but I could not help overhearing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.50,0:41:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到你和那个商贩的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}the conversation you had just now with that salesman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.10,0:41:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这件事我也许能帮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can be of assistance to you in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea, who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.10,0:41:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是歇洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.60,0:41:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的工作就是知道别人不知道的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my business to know what other people don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.80,0:41:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你不可能知道这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you could know nothing of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.80,0:41:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相反 我知道得一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, I know everything of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.40,0:41:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你想寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you are trying to find out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.60,0:41:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布里克斯顿路的奥克肖特太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whereabouts of some geese sold by Mrs. Oakshott, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.30,0:41:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖给布莱肯里奇某批鹅的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Brixton Road, to our friend, Mr. Breckinridge, over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.30,0:41:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而布莱肯里奇又将鹅卖给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who in turn, sold them to Mr. Windigate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.50,0:41:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿尔法小酒店的温迪盖特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Alpha Public House.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.00,0:42:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 你就是我要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you're the very man I have longed to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.40,0:42:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无法表达我对此事有多大的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hardly explain to you my interest in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.80,0:42:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我建议还是在个更舒服的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I suggest that we carry on this conversation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.00,0:42:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}讨论此事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}in rather more comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.70,0:42:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.90,0:42:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进来 坐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, take my chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.50,0:42:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去换拖鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will just put on my slippers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.40,0:42:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们得先知道我们有幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should know the name of the gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.20,0:42:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为之效劳的人是谁 对吧 华生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom we have the pleasure of assisting, don't you, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.20,0:42:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·鲁宾逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Robinson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.30,0:42:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.50,0:42:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是问你的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your real name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.80,0:43:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}办正事用化名总不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is so awkward doing business with an alias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.40,0:43:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.40,0:43:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的真名是赖德 詹姆斯·赖德\N{\fnArial\fs30}my real name is Ryder, James Ryder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.40,0:43:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 赖德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Ryder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.40,0:43:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界旅馆的领班\N{\fnArial\fs30}upper attendant at the Hotel Cosmopolitan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.70,0:43:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.60,0:43:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该很想知道那些鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I suppose you would like to know what happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.50,0:43:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的下落 尤其是其中一只\N{\fnArial\fs30}to these geese, or, rather, one goose, in particular, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.60,0:43:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是那只白体灰冠的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}white, with a gray head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.30,0:43:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 先生 你能告诉我它的下落吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sir, can you tell me where it went to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.50,0:43:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它来过我这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.50,0:43:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.00,0:43:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惜的是 它已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, it is no longer here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.60,0:43:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这只鹅死后下了一个蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it laid an egg after it was dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.80,0:43:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所见过的最美丽最闪亮的蓝色小蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bonniest, brightest little blue egg you have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.60,0:43:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 来 我给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come, I have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.80,0:44:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游戏结束了 赖德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game is up, Ryder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.00,0:44:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}站稳了 当心跌进壁炉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear up, man, you'll be in the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.70,0:44:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可怜虫的确很瘦小\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what a wretched little shrimp it is, to be sure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.70,0:44:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他再没勇气去犯重罪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's enough blood in him for felony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.90,0:44:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经基本掌握了案件的所有环节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have almost every link in the chain, Ryder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.00,0:44:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也没什么好告诉我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need tell me very little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.50,0:44:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是凯瑟琳·丘萨克唆使我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catherine Cusack put me up to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.50,0:44:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是伯爵夫人的女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her Ladyship's maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.10,0:44:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.90,0:44:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你从小道消息得知霍纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew from local gossip that Horner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.50,0:44:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经有类似的盗窃行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been concerned in some such matter before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.20,0:44:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你都干了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did you do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你的同伙丘萨克在伯爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you made some small job in milady's room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.40,0:44:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的房间里动了点手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your confederate Cusack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.50,0:44:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你设法把霍纳叫去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You then managed that Horner should be sent for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.90,0:45:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你偷了宝石 还报了警\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, you stole the jewel, then you raised the alarm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.00,0:45:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸的霍纳锒铛入狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and had this unfortunate man arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.00,0:45:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 可怜可怜我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, Mr. Holmes, have mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.10,0:45:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想我的爸爸 我的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of my father, think of my mother, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.50,0:45:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们会伤心欲绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would break their hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.70,0:45:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前从没干过坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I never went wrong before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.10,0:45:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以后再也不敢了 我可以手按圣经发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never will again. I swear it on a Bible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.60,0:45:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别把我送去法庭 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't… don't bring me to court, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.10,0:45:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 千万别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, don't do that to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.70,0:45:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}坐回椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back into your chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.10,0:45:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在倒知道跪地求饶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very well to cringe and crawl now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.10,0:45:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你怎么不可怜可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you thought little of the man that you sent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.90,0:45:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫不知情却因你而上被告席的霍纳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the dock for a crime of which he knew nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.90,0:45:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会远走高飞 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fly, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.10,0:45:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会离开这个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.90,0:45:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么对他的指控也就撤销了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the charge against him will break down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.20,0:45:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点待会再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll talk about that later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.10,0:45:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在告诉我 宝石是怎么跑进鹅的肚子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell me, how came the stone into the goose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.90,0:45:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而鹅又怎么会被拿去市场卖的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how came the goose into the open market?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.00,0:45:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me the truth, now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.90,0:45:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你保命的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}for that is your only hope of safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.30,0:46:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把发生的一切都告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell it to you just as it happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.20,0:46:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想最好是带着宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was best to get away with the stone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.00,0:46:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}立即逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}as quick as I could, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.60,0:46:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不知道警察何时会想起\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I didn't know at what moment the police might not take it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.10,0:46:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去搜查我和我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}into their heads to search me and my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.10,0:46:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旅馆里没有一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nowhere in the hotel where it would be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.50,0:46:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我假装受人差遣走出旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I went out, as if on some commission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.20,0:46:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后去姐姐家想再作打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made for my sister's house to think things over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.60,0:46:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 杰姆 你看上去糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Jim, whatever is it, you look terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.60,0:46:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我受了点惊吓 麦琪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a bit of a turn, Maggie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}旅馆里发生了盗窃案\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a robbery at the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.60,0:46:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你快进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd better come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.80,0:46:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走进她饲养鹅的后院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went into the back yard where she kept the geese, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.50,0:46:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抽着烟 琢磨着该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}smoked a pipe, and wondered what it would be best to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.50,0:46:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得在没想好暂时把石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that my stomach wasn't gonna stop{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.10,0:46:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}藏于何处之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}feeling like a bag of ferrets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.30,0:46:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直心慌意乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}till I found somewhere to hide the stone for a while, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.50,0:46:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突然 我看见鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}when suddenly, I looked at the geese, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.90,0:46:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挤在院子角落里咕咕乱叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}which was hissing and huddling in the corner of the yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.90,0:47:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐曾告诉我 我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister had told me that I might have the pick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.70,0:47:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挑一只鹅作为圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}of her geese for a Christmas present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.70,0:47:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我挑了一只鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I picked out one of the birds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.70,0:47:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有灰冠的一只上好肥鹅\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fine thick one with a gray head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.10,0:47:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把宝石塞进它喉咙里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pushed the stone down its throat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.40,0:47:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直塞到手指能够达到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as my finger could reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.20,0:47:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为所有的麻烦都解决了 这时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I thought all my troubles was over, when…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.40,0:47:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你抱着那鹅干嘛呢 杰姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever are you doing with that bird, Jim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.00,0:47:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说过我可以挑一只当圣诞礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you said I could have one for Christmas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.80,0:47:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在试摸哪一只最肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I was just feeling which is the fattest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.30,0:47:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们早把你那只留出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already set yours aside…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.50,0:47:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们管它叫「杰姆的鹅」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim's bird, we call it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.40,0:47:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呃 麦琪 反正哪只对你都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if it's all the same to you, Maggie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.40,0:48:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要我刚才手上抓着的那只\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather have that one I was handling just now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.00,0:48:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可给你留着的那只还要重3磅呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that one is a good three pounds heavier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.30,0:48:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可是特地喂肥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we fattened it up expressly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.90,0:48:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.60,0:48:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就要那只 我现在就拿走啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the other, and I'll take it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.60,0:48:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as you like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.00,0:48:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要的是哪一只？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.30,0:48:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是中间有灰冠的那只\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that gray-headed one in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.70,0:48:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.10,0:48:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把它宰了 然后带走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill it and take it with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.50,0:48:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我照她说的做了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what she said, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.50,0:48:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我带着鹅去了我朋友家 我们用刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I carried the bird to my pal, we got a knife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.40,0:48:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将鹅开膛 我的心一下子凉了半截\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we opened it up, my heart turned to water, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.60,0:48:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗉囊里根本没有蓝宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was no sign of the stone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.20,0:48:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道肯定出岔子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I knew some terrible mistake must have occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.70,0:48:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些鹅都去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have they all gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卖给商贩子了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the dealer's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.00,0:49:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪个商贩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which dealer's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.00,0:49:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}考文特园的布莱肯里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breckinridge, of Covent Garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.70,0:49:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, just tell me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.70,0:49:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是还有一只鹅也是灰冠的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}was there another one which had a gray head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 一共两只\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, two, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.90,0:49:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连我都分不清它们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never tell them apart, I couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.40,0:49:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 你怎么那么慌张？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's the matter, what's all the hurry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.80,0:49:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我竭尽全力飞奔到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran as hard as my feet would carry me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.80,0:49:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱肯里奇那\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this man Breckinridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.80,0:49:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他已经把鹅卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he had sold the lot, and not one word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.50,0:49:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不肯告诉我都卖给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}would he tell me as to where they had gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.00,0:49:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gone mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.80,0:49:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我已经打上「小偷」的烙印了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm a branded thief, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.90,0:49:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管我没有得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}without ever having touched the wealth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.90,0:49:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为此出卖人格的财宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}for which I've sold my character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.40,0:49:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝宽恕我吧 上帝宽恕我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}God help me. God help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.30,0:50:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.80,0:50:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿上帝保佑你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heavens, bless you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.20,0:50:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.50,0:50:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}滚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.10,0:50:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得承认 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must confess, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.50,0:50:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有点出乎我的意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}to being a little surprised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.30,0:50:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还没被请到警局告诉他们所不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not retained by the police to supply their deficiencies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.30,0:51:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我也犯了重罪 但我也可能救了某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am committing a felony, but I may be saving a soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.50,0:51:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果把他送进监狱 那他终身都是囚犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him to jail now, you make him a jailbird for life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.70,0:51:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毕竟 现在正是大赦时节 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, after all, it is the season for forgiveness, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.50,0:51:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}半夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.50,0:51:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merry Christmas, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.90,0:51:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣诞快乐 我亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to you, my dear friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.30,0:51:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.20,0:51:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 约翰·霍纳还被关押着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, I cannot contemplate eating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.80,0:51:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一想到此事我就没法安心吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}while John Horner is still on remand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.10,0:51:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想 布雷兹特里或者他的同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you suppose that Bradstreet or one of his colleagues{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.70,0:51:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许还在苦苦查案呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}might still be at their desks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.24,0:52:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说得对 华生 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will. You're quite right, Watson, come, let's go.{\r}
